# Working documents. These are wireframes, briefs and copy decks that arrive
# as folders beside the site, and Vercel serves whatever it is given: the
# build brief was live at /The Build page/files/CLAUDE-CODE-BRIEF.md and
# returning 200 to anyone who guessed the path. Add the folder here the same
# day a new one lands, and never park a working document inside a route
# directory like the-build/.
